System.DateTime       0001-01-01 00:00:00   Unspecified
System.DateTimeOffset 0001-01-01 00:00:00   Utc
Unix time             1970-01-01 00:00:00   Utc
Windows file time     1601-01-01 00:00:00   Utc

a tick is 100ns since the type's own epoch, so
2026-09-21 12:00:00 is 639255888000000000 ticks
and 1789992000 seconds of Unix time
